         <pdf:Producer>Adobe PDF Library 10.0</pdf:Producer>
         <pdf:Keywords>Parker Hannifin; SSD Drives; frequency inverter; AC drives; open-loop v/f fluxing; closed-loop v/f fluxing; sensorless flex vector; sensorless servo; variable speed control; function block programming; suitable for operation with permanent magnet AC (PMAC) and AC induction motors; 208-500VAC; outputs up to 30kW/40HP; common DC bus rail; active front end&#xD;&#xA;</pdf:Keywords>
      </rdf:Description>
